# THE ONKELOS ROWS of Deuteronomy 12:1-16 (THE DEUTERONOMY WALK sitting 10 — CHAPTER 12, 2026-09-20; the one run): the header, the destruction, the place
# chosen, the offerings and the rejoicing, not as here today, the rest, the Jordan, the Levite, the burnt offerings only there, the profane slaughter and the
# blood. The Aramaic and the Hebrew CUT by consonants in GLOSSED PIECES of at most seven tokens (ch12_ink.HP / AP — the lint's ninety-character window). The
# second file carries 12:17-31. The export's chapter 12 = the DB's (thirty-one rows, the identity — asserted). EVERY ROW READ WHOLE (the whole-row rule;
